[STYLE]
Realistic Korean office comedy drama, 2000s K-drama look, warm fluorescent lighting,
beige cubicle partitions, cluttered desks with stacked binders, cinematic, 16:9,
natural film grain, slightly exaggerated comedic acting, no logos, no on-screen text.

[CHARACTERS]
- HERO: Korean man, late 20s, messy black hair, white shirt, many yellow-green sticky
  notes stuck on his back and shoulders.
- COLLEAGUE A: Korean woman, early 30s, long dark hair, black-rimmed glasses, beige cardigan.
- COLLEAGUE B: Korean man, early 30s, short black hair, light blue striped shirt.
- TEAM LEAD LEE: Korean man, late 40s, balding with gray sides, reading glasses,
  navy suit, pink tie.

[VOICES] (keep exactly the same voice for each character in every shot)
- HERO: young male, slightly high and nasal, whiny and flustered, standard Seoul Korean.
- COLLEAGUE A: female, early 30s, soft slightly husky voice, fast gossiping whisper.
- COLLEAGUE B: male, early 30s, light mid-pitch voice, easily shocked.
- TEAM LEAD LEE: male, late 40s, deep warm baritone, hearty laugh.
- NARRATOR: bright, clear female announcer voice, friendly and confident.
All dialogue is spoken in Korean.

[SHOTS]
Shot 1 (0-4s) Small meeting room with a whiteboard, medium-wide side angle.
TEAM LEAD LEE sits at the table looking at his open laptop, nodding with an impressed
smile. HERO stands beside him. COLLEAGUE A and COLLEAGUE B sit in the background.
  TEAM LEAD LEE (0-2.8s, delighted): "오, 이번 거 좋은데? 구성도 깔끔하고 근거도 탄탄하네. 이대로 보고 올리자."
  COLLEAGUE A and COLLEAGUE B (1.5s, small gasp together, hands near mouths): "헉!"
  HERO (2.8-4s, shy smile, scratching his head, small bow): "아, 하하… 감사합니다!"

Shot 2 (4-5.5s) Over-the-shoulder from behind TEAM LEAD LEE. He throws his head back
laughing, shoulders shaking, while the camera slowly pushes in toward his laptop,
which shows a plain bright white blank screen.
  TEAM LEAD LEE (4-5.5s, hearty laugh): "하하하하!"

Shot 3 (5.5-8s) The bright white blank laptop screen fills the entire frame, very slow
continued push-in, soft glow. No text on the screen.

Shot 4 (8-9s) Wide high-angle shot of the whole open-plan office, every monitor glowing
soft pink, the camera slowly pulling back.
  NARRATOR (8-9s, playful): "너 빼고 다 쓰고 있는, 시엠프레."

Light comic background music, quieter than the voices, same music style as before.
